# Local overrides (Shameekh)

This rule wins over the Git authorization in `CLAUDE.md`.

Never `git add`, `git commit`, `git push`, `gh pr create`, `gh pr merge`, or any other git/GitHub
write unless Shameekh explicitly asks for that action in the current message.

"Task complete" is not permission. Do not leave unsolicited PR/issue comments unless asked.
When work is done, report the changed files and stop.

## Specs are scratch, not shipped

Write `*.spec.ts` / `*.test.ts` files and run them to verify the feature. When verification is
done, **delete every spec/test file you created for this work** — do not leave them in the
diff. Do not delete tests that already existed in the repo before this task. Keep them only if
Shameekh explicitly asks.
